# root ships LOCKED. "!" is not a password hash -- it is the marker that means
# "no password will ever match", so nothing secret is committed and nothing can
# log in until the first boot asks for one.
#
# There is deliberately no ordinary user here. The account is created on first
# boot with a name you choose, because an OS that ships someone else's username
# is an OS with a stranger's name on your machine.
#
# Fields: name:hash:last-change:min-age:max-age:warn:inactive:expire:reserved
root:!:20000:0:99999:7:::
